sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant EDGE as Cloudflare + proxy
    participant W as web (Next.js + BFF)
    participant R as Redis
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant API as auth (API + Prisma)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    rect rgb(235, 244, 255)
    Note over C,KC: 1) Login OIDC (patron BFF)
    C->>EDGE: GET /login
    EDGE->>W: reenvia
    W-->>C: redirect a Keycloak (PKCE)
    C->>KC: credenciales (+ MFA)
    KC-->>W: tokens (back-channel)
    W->>R: guarda sesion -> sid
    W-->>C: Set-Cookie sid (HttpOnly)
    end

    rect rgb(236, 248, 240)
    Note over C,DB: 2) Request autenticado
    C->>W: fetch /api/... (cookie sid)
    W->>R: valida sid
    W->>API: proxy (usuario + token)
    API->>DB: consulta (Prisma, SQL parametrizado)
    DB-->>API: filas
    API->>API: deriva estado de asistencia
    API-->>C: JSON
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 250)
    Note over C,DB: 3) Ingesta biometrica (asincrona)
    C->>API: POST /iclock (marca + huella)
    API->>DB: persiste marca
    API->>API: alimenta motor de asistencia
    API-->>C: 200 OK
    end
